proposed_fix:
Add to .github/dependabot.yml:
  - package-ecosystem: "docker-compose"
    directory: "/"
    schedule: {interval: weekly}
    groups: {compose-images: {patterns: ["*"]}}
and bump the compose pin to postgres:16.15-alpine with its current multi-platform digest before v3.0.0-rc.1. Keep README's "16.13 or newer" statement (still true).

